 "note": "The press-two-tabs latch, v7, on both packs, side by side: the Scout's on the left, the Overseer's on the right. One latch module: the same slider, springs, 3 x 20 dowels, magnets and grabber blades; only the cartridge and the receiver are sized to the pack. Each is cut at its tab line. Made stronger on 10 Nov: bolts 42 wide on two steel pins each, blades 34 wide with two hooks each, four springs. Scout 222.0 g with its cartridge, Overseer 765.8 g. Both fit their landing funnel: clear seated, in 65 landing states and on the swap path; the Scout receiver stands on four landing feet. Worst strength index 0.483 (Scout), 0.361 (Overseer). Numbers under the viewer.",
